O patch 0121 trouxe de volta a linha que o 0028 já tinha corrigido: o ?:
mistura KisImageWSP e KisImageSP e o compilador recusa. Atribuição em duas
linhas, sem mudar o comportamento.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012fwRUW9SkxqcJFLYxLRXTf
---
 libs/ui/NanquimTabletUi.cpp | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libs/ui/NanquimTabletUi.cpp b/libs/ui/NanquimTabletUi.cpp
index fa06bdf..a645b35 100644
--- a/libs/ui/NanquimTabletUi.cpp
+++ b/libs/ui/NanquimTabletUi.cpp
@@ -13894,7 +13894,8 @@ void showWebtoonToolsSheet(KisMainWindow *mw, int initialTab)
 {
     if (!mw) return;
     KisView *view = mw->activeView();
-    KisImageSP image = view ? view->image() : KisImageSP();
+    KisImageSP image;
+    if (view) image = view->image();
 
     QDialog *d = makeSheet(mw, 620, 640);
     QVBoxLayout *root = new QVBoxLayout(d);
